      fix(hcl): add $...X ellipsis-metavariable and fix namespaced function calls
      
      Wire `$...IDENT` into `body`, `object_elem`, and `_expr_term` so it
      parses as a block-body element, object entry, attribute value,
      function argument, and tuple element. Add a postfix
      `_expr_term get_attr ( args )` production on `_expr_term` so
      namespaced calls like `$NS.$F($ARG)` and `provider.fn(arg)` parse;
      the existing postfix `_expr_term get_attr` production still handles
      plain attribute access (`foo.bar`), and a new `[$._expr_term]`
      conflict entry keeps both parses live until the trailing `(` (or its
      absence) disambiguates.
      
      Fixes LANG-490, LANG-498.
      
